sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Guest
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant Auth as AuthController
  participant Service as AuthService
  participant Otp as EmailOtpRepository
  participant User as UserRepository

  Guest->>Web: Enter OTP
  Web->>Auth: POST /api/v1/auth/verify-email
  Auth->>Service: verifyEmail(request)
  Service->>Otp: Load active OTP
  Service->>Service: Compare OTP hash and expiry
  Service->>User: Activate user and assign STUDENT role
  Service->>Otp: Mark OTP consumed
  Service-->>Auth: Verification result
  Auth-->>Web: 200 OK
  Web-->>Guest: Show success message
